wb-node-red (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. One-command `apt install wb-node-red` for Node-RED on
    Wiren Board controllers:
    - runs a byte-for-byte mirror of vanilla nodered/node-red (no derived
      build); the pure-JS WB palette node-red-contrib-wirenboard is npm-vendored
      into the package at build time and refreshed into /data/node_modules at
      install, so the editor has the WB nodes out of the box with no runtime npm;
    - default flow pre-wired to the local MQTT broker (172.29.0.1:11883) and the
      device tree (/devices/#);
    - reverse-proxied on its own port behind the homeui login (auth_request,
      admin role) via a standalone nginx server block;
    - user data persists under /mnt/data across upgrades; updates are explicit
      (apt upgrade).

 -- Wiren Board Team <info@wirenboard.com>  Fri, 19 Jun 2026 12:00:00 +0300
